  "Id": "f44e5acd-ee4f-570f-9d48-f2248c42297d"/*VolumeMeshRoundtripExample*/,
  "Description": "Mesh to volume and back: [VolumeFromMesh] voxelizes a mesh into an SDF, [VolumeMorphology] dilates it, and [VolumeToMesh] re-extracts a watertight surface. This is the workflow for remeshing, booleaning and smoothing arbitrary geometry.",
